    # The visible seven-engine cluster is also the physical main-engine mount.
    # Keep the thrust actuator on this stable, authored assembly path so the
    # Modelica combustion output reaches Avian in the same USD graph as the
    # RCS actuators.  The previous Griffin asset exposed thrust telemetry but
    # had no main-force actuator, so powered descent could not brake the body.
